64	csrc/fused/sm_90/model_stage_decoder_tc.cuh first (see .phase2/RUNBOOK.md). \
65	This is a loud gate, not an optional feature — building PP stages against the \
66	unpatched single-stage tile functions would silently run the wrong layers."
